<title>ISRAEL: Israeli soldier shoots Palestinians in Hebron.</title>
<headline>Israeli soldier shoots Palestinians in Hebron.</headline>
<dateline>HEBRON, West Bank 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Israeli soldier opened fire, wounding at least two Palestinians in the Arab market of the West Bank town of Hebron on Wednesday, witnesses said.</p>
<p>They said soldiers arrested the soldier who had fired.</p>
</text>
